	quest.202FC021DB1C9366.quest_desc: [
		"To make rubber sheets, start by mixing &#555555Coal&r and &#58AAFFWater&r in a &#FFB503Mixer&r. This will produce &aRaw Synthetic Oil&r. "
		""
		"Next, take the &eRaw Synthetic Oil&r and run it through any &#FFB503Blast Furnace&r to refine it into &aSynthetic Oil&r. "
		""
		"After it’s refined, insert &eSynthetic Oil&r and &#C3D0B4Paper&r together in a &#FFB503Mixer&r. "
		""
		"Once the process is finished, it will output &a12 Rubber Sheets&r."
	]
